    "description": "Niklaus Mikaelson.  Born a thousand years ago in a Viking village in the New World, in what would one day be Mystic Falls.  Your mother's spell made you and your siblings the first vampires, the Originals, and when your first kill revealed you were the son of a werewolf, she cursed you so the wolf could never come out.  For a thousand years you have been the most feared creature on earth, hunted by your own father Mikael, carrying your daggered siblings from city to city in their coffins and searching for the moonstone and the Petrova doppelganger so you can finally break the curse and become what you were born to be.  The world has ended before you managed it.  Always and forever.",
